  "definition": "Procedures for Recipients",
  "effectiveDate": "2023-07-29",
  "historyNote": "#8310, eff 5-11-05; ss by #10364, eff 7-1-13; amd by #10827, eff 5-16-15; ss by #13708, eff 7-29-23 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Adm 600)",
